开场对话：

`;e.story.dialogue.forEach((line,j)=>doc+=`${j+1}. **${line.speaker}**：${line.text}

`);doc+="调查线索：

";e.investigations.forEach((inv,j)=>doc+=`- ${inv.label}：${e.story.clues[j]}

